# Context

## Background
NOTES.md flagged the agent session storage findings as unverified:
they came partly from third-party writeups, and this was a new machine.

## Why This Way
All phase 1 agents turned out to be installed locally with real
session corpora, so every claim could be checked against actual
files instead of writeups. Two claims changed as a result: Pi
sessions live globally under ~/.pi/agent/sessions/ (not in
project-local .pi/), and OpenCode v2.0.12 moved from per-message
JSON files to SQLite (opencode.db).

